# 💰 ChowPal — Year 1 Projected Cost Breakdown

> Total Year 1 Investment: **$850,000 – $1,200,000**
> Average Monthly Burn Rate: **$70K – $100K**

---

## Budget Allocation at a Glance

| Category | Low Estimate | High Estimate | Share of Total |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Personnel** | $595,000 | $840,000 | 70% |
| **Infrastructure** | $170,000 | $240,000 | 20% |
| **Operations** | $85,000 | $120,000 | 10% |
| **Total** | **$850,000** | **$1,200,000** | **100%** |

The budget is structured for a lean but feature-rich marketplace. The majority goes toward the people who build and run the product, with the remaining funds covering cloud infrastructure and core business operations needed to keep the service stable and compliant.

---

## 1. Personnel — $595K to $840K (70%)

### Engineering Team — $540K to $680K

| Role | Qty | Salary Range | Annual Cost | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Full-Stack Engineer | 2 | $140K–$180K each | $280K–$360K | Core platform — recipe feed, user profiles, search, backend APIs |
| Mobile Developer | 1 | $130K–$160K | $130K–$160K | iOS and Android native apps, video playback optimization |
| DevOps Engineer | 1 | $130K–$160K | $130K–$160K | AWS infrastructure, CI/CD pipeline, monitoring, auto-scaling |

Salary ranges assume mid-level engineers (3–5 years experience) hired in mid-tier tech cities like Boston, Seattle, or Austin, or working remotely. Equity grants of 0.5–1.5% are factored in to reduce cash needs. San Francisco-based hires would cost 30–40% more.

### Product and Design Team — $210K to $270K

| Role | Qty | Salary Range | Annual Cost | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Product Manager | 1 | $120K–$150K | $120K–$150K | Product strategy, roadmap, feature prioritization, user research |
| UX/UI Designer | 1 | $90K–$120K | $90K–$120K | App design, user flows, branding, visual identity, wireframes |

The designer role is critical — international students need culturally relevant, intuitive design that accounts for diverse dietary labels, multilingual content, and cuisine-specific visual patterns.

### Business Operations Team — $150K to $190K

| Role | Qty | Salary Range | Annual Cost | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Partnership Manager | 1 | $80K–$100K | $80K–$100K | Onboard ethnic grocers, manage store relationships, negotiate terms |
| Community Manager | 1 | $70K–$90K | $70K–$90K | Customer support, creator onboarding, content moderation, social media |

The Partnership Manager is revenue-critical — ChowPal's marketplace model lives or dies by store partnerships. The Community Manager handles multilingual support (English, Hindi, Mandarin, Arabic), creator disputes, and content moderation, preventing burnout on the rest of the team.

### Benefits and Taxes — ~$95K to $160K

Loaded cost adds approximately 30% on top of base salaries, covering employer payroll taxes (7.65%), health insurance (~$8K per employee per year), 401(k) matching (3–5%), PTO, and workers' compensation.

