## Funding Strategy

**Recommended path: Pre-Seed / Seed Round**

| Parameter | Details |
|---|---|
| Target Raise | $1.5M–$2M |
| Use of Funds | $850K–$1.2M for Year 1 ops, $300K–$500K for Year 2 runway, $200K–$300K buffer |
