### What If the Budget Is Only $500K?

| Adjustment | Savings |
|---|---|
| Start with 1 full-stack engineer instead of 2 | –$140K |
| Delay mobile developer hire to Month 4 | –$65K |
| Use cheaper CDN (Bunny instead of Cloudflare) | –$20K |
| Zero paid marketing — 100% organic | –$30K |
| Founders take no or reduced salary for 6 months | –$120K |
| **Total Savings** | **–$375K** |

This brings the budget down to $475K–$825K and is feasible if founders are technical, the team works fully remote, the MVP is truly minimal (iOS only, no AI filtering in V1), and additional funding is raised by Month 6 based on traction.

