## Key Cost Risks to Monitor

**High Risk / High Variability:**
Engineering salaries (40% of budget) — talent shortage could drive costs up 20–30%. Mitigation: hire remote, offer equity, consider earlier-career engineers. CDN and infrastructure (15% of budget) — viral growth could spike traffic 10x overnight. Mitigation: set spending alerts and negotiate volume discounts upfront. Legal and compliance (2–3% of budget) — a FERPA violation carries fines of $50K+ plus legal costs. Mitigation: invest in proper compliance from Day 1.

**Medium Risk:**
Marketing and user acquisition — customer acquisition cost may be higher than projected. Mitigation: prioritize organic growth and test paid channels slowly before committing budget.

**Low Risk / Predictable:**
Tools and subscriptions — costs are known, fixed, and easy to forecast. No significant mitigation needed.

